            </div><p>Say a limiter allows 100 requests per minute. At 11:59:59 a user sends 100. At 12:00:01 they send 100 more. That&rsquo;s 200 requests in 2 seconds, and one common implementation lets all of them through.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>